403 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 157 0 R
/T (After materials are sufficiently processed and published, we will store the TIFs and CSV file in our server. This allows us to properly preserve the material in formats that resist data loss. Partners still own their own materials and can submit image requests at any time for the original archival masters kept on our server.)
/E (After materials are sufficiently processed and published, we will store the TIFs and CSV file in our server. This allows us to properly preserve the material in formats that resist data loss. Partners still own their own materials and can submit image requests at any time for the original archival masters kept on our server.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
